  "Posted 10 November 2001, before Theed Palace (12 December 2001), so the format is Premiere - Reflections III.",
  "Starting (7) as posted: TDIGWATT (This Deal Is Getting Worse All The Time), Cloud City: Port Town District, Secret Plans, Prepared Defenses, I'm Sorry, Crush The Rebellion, Inconsequential Losses; these count toward the 60. No Fear Is My Ally or Defensive Shields are posted.",
  "Posted 'Secret Plans' in the Starting section dested the Special Edition Effect Secret Plans, which the objective may deploy.",
  "Posted 'Vader with Sabre' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Capt Bewil' Captain Bewil; 'Sgt Merril' Sergeant Merril; 'Mara Jade's Lightsabre' Mara Jade's Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'Cloud City' dested Bespin: Cloud City (Dark); 'CC Downtown Plaza', 'CC West Gallery' and 'CC Lower Corridor' the Dark printings of those sites.",
